// #74: with the SYN queue full a SYN is answered with a cookie in the ISN
// and nothing is kept (syncookies.c); the ACK that returns it still opens
// the connection, with the MSS rounded down to what the cookie can carry
// (msstab: 1400 becomes 1300).
0      listen 8080 0
+0.1   < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     from 40001
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1400>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0.01  < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     accept
+0     state ESTABLISHED
+0     send 1400
+0     > P. 1:1301(1300) ack 1
+0     > P. 1301:1401(100) ack 1
